   "`tools/art/room_desk.py` from the prototype, arguments `--out <png> --variant ledger|bookings [--samples N]` (bad variant: message and exit 2). `set_view(62.0, 20.0)`; opaque render. Ledger: green leather top #2b5a3c, open red ledger book (two pages, cream paper) at screen (560,420), brass banker's lamp with green shade at (150,200) with a warm point light (energy 500), calculator at (1150,250), mug with tea at (1100,560). Bookings: dark planks top (`tex_mat` planks #4a2c18/#6b4528), a cream telephone made of boxes (base 1.1x0.8x0.25 m, handset box on top, black dial cylinder) at screen (1180,130), a yellow notepad at (150,520), the same lamp and mug.",
